Others have pointed out that Alt-2 might not work the expected way on your
system (in which case you should use #twoweapon with the hash), but
there's also another possible reason:
Have you checked that you have some other weapon in your secondary hand?
To #twoweaponing you first need one weapon secondary and one wielded.
You can check this in your inventory listing, the secondary weapon will
have the text "(alternate weapon; not wielded)" at the end of the
description. 
(This may seem obvious, but you didn't specify how well you know the
procedure and I don't remember it from your posting history..)

